  <Placemark>
   <name>Small Craft Advisory issued October 3 at 8:34PM EDT until October 5 at 2:00AM EDT by NWS Mount Holly NJ</name>
   <styleUrl>#sev_minor</styleUrl>
   <Style>
    <BalloonStyle />
   </Style>
   <Snippet>* WHAT...Northeast winds 10 to 20 kt with gusts up to 25 kt and
seas 3 to 5 ft.

* WHERE...Coastal waters from Cape May NJ to Cape Henlopen DE
out 20 NM and Coastal waters from Cape Henlopen to Fenwick
Island DE out 20 NM.

* WHEN...Until 2 AM EDT Monday.

* IMPACTS...Conditions will be hazardous to small craft.</Snippet>
