   <name>Small Craft Advisory issued October 3 at 8:29PM EDT until October 5 at 8:00AM EDT by NWS Detroit/Pontiac MI</name>
   <styleUrl>#sev_minor</styleUrl>
   <Style>
    <BalloonStyle />
   </Style>
   <Snippet>* WHAT...Expect sustained winds up to 18 knots from the west
with gusts up to 24 knots. The largest significant waves will
be 3 feet with a potential maximum wave height of 4 feet.

* WHERE...Outer Saginaw Bay SW of Alabaster to Port Austin MI to
Inner Saginaw Bay.

* WHEN...The maximum winds are expected around 8 PM EDT Sunday
with the largest waves expected around 11 PM EDT Sunday.

* IMPACTS...Conditions will be hazardous to small craft.</Snippet>
