   <Snippet>...The Flood Warning is extended for the following rivers in
Kansas...

Republican River at Clay Center affecting Clay County.

* WHAT...Minor flooding is forecast.

* WHERE...Republican River at Clay Center.

* WHEN...Until Sunday afternoon.

* IMPACTS...At 15.0 feet, Lowland agricultural flooding occurs from
U.S. Highway 24 to Milford Lake.

* ADDITIONAL DETAILS...
- At 5:30 PM CDT Saturday the stage was 15.0 feet.
- Forecast...The river is expected to rise above flood stage this
evening to a crest of 15.2 feet around midnight tonight. It will
then fall below flood stage Sunday morning.
- Flood stage is 15.0 feet.</Snippet>
