   <Snippet>* WHAT...Flooding caused by excessive rainfall is expected.

* WHERE...Northwestern Jefferson Parish in southeastern Louisiana...
St. Charles Parish in southeastern Louisiana...

* WHEN...Until 830 PM CDT.

* IMPACTS...Minor flooding in low-lying and poor drainage areas.

