   </Style>
   <Snippet>...The National Weather Service in Lake Charles has issued a Flood
Warning for the following rivers in Louisiana...

Calcasieu River near White Oak Park affecting Calcasieu Parish.

Calcasieu River Near Salt Water Barrier affecting Calcasieu Parish.

For the Calcasieu River...including Glenmora, Oakdale, Oberlin,
Kinder, White Oak Park, Salt Water Barrier...Minor flooding is
forecast.

* WHAT...Minor flooding is forecast.

* WHERE...Calcasieu River near Salt Water Barrier.

* WHEN...From late tonight to late Monday night.

* ADDITIONAL DETAILS...
- At 8:45 PM CDT Friday the stage was 1.8 feet.
- Forecast...The river will oscillate around flood stage with a
maximum value of 4.2 feet tomorrow morning.
- Flood stage is 4.0 feet.
- http://www.weather.gov/safety/flood</Snippet>
